WEBVTT

00:29:27.230 --> 00:29:30.083
your ethnicity, how old you are,

00:29:30.107 --> 00:29:35.416
and then show up as my imagined version

00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:38.066
of who that ought to be."

00:29:38.090 --> 00:29:42.916
There is often a sense
that I would benefit professionally

00:29:42.940 --> 00:29:47.406
if I were less Latina-ish Liz Lemon

00:29:47.430 --> 00:29:52.456
and more, to quote Cardi B,
"spicy mommy hot tamale."

00:29:52.480 --> 00:29:58.571
It would be like, "I need this,
but smokier." (Laughs)

00:29:58.595 --> 00:30:01.558
AG: (Laughs) What? People tell you that?